sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Backend as Fastify API
  participant BullMQ as BullMQ (erp-sync)
  participant Bling as ERP Bling v3
  participant SEFAZ as SEFAZ Estadual
  participant Correios as Correios SIGEP
  participant Unicentro as Unicentro (Encarnación PY)

  Backend->>BullMQ: Enqueue erp-sync (Order PAID)
  BullMQ->>Bling: POST /v3/pedidos/vendas
  Bling-->>BullMQ: Retorna pedidoId
  BullMQ->>Bling: POST /v3/nf-e (modelo 55)
  Bling->>SEFAZ: Transmite XML NF-e
  SEFAZ-->>Bling: Autoriza uso (chave 44 dígitos + DANFE)
  Bling-->>BullMQ: NF-e EMITTED
  BullMQ->>Bling: POST /v3/etiquetas/correios (PAC 03298)
  Bling->>Correios: Solicita código internacional RR...PY
  Correios-->>Bling: Etiqueta + trackingCode
  BullMQ->>Unicentro: Notifica separação do pacote c/ DANFE + Etiqueta
